	annote = {Analyse des Artikels "Hasil Belajar Kognitif Materi Geografi Kelas X Menggunakan Model Computer-Supported Collaborative Learning (CSCL)" von Rantian Virta Eka Pratiwi et al. (2024)
1. Analyse
