Technologische Herausforderungen: „Technological constraints, such as poor internet connectivity and lack of digital literacy, can hinder the effectiveness of collaborative writing activities.“ (S. 71)


Empfehlungen für zukünftige Forschungen: „Future research should focus on larger sample sizes and improved technological solutions to better understand and enhance the pedagogical impact of collaborative writing.“ (S. 73)


